From bacbfc3ef1ea16508cc24279488421eafd96c174 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:52:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(ui): move the Work offset control from the Setup
 page to the WCS page

The Work offset (G54-G59) picker is drawn on the WCS page in its own
group. The Setup page keeps the part orientation controls and the
"Set WCS from features" row. The command and the setup's slot are
unchanged.

Fixes #1648

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
